        "id": 1945845
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-07-29T04:31:36Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Ah, thanks for the extra context! I appreciate it!\n\nWould it make sense to just enable the specific log output generally? Or create a new boot option that would be available on all GKI kernels? Or maybe allow pm_debug_messages to have verbosity levels?\n\nI\u0027m mostly just concerned with adding more vendor-hook tech-debt instead of trying for a more general solution that has the potential to be upstreamed.",
      "parentUuid": "3a555421_2f336936",
      "revId": "d5bc54642cc1f9b99c18e73e4402fc45b25d3e3d",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "8f499d5b_21878e62",
        "filename": "/PATCHSET_LEVEL",
        "patchSetId": 3
      },
      "lineNbr": 0,
